  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ニビ科学博物館　監修の　テーブルクロス。アカデミックな　雰囲気の色柄は子供にも　大人にも　大人気。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "회색시티 과학 박물관이 감수한 테이블보. 학구적인 분위기의 색상과 무늬는 어른과 아이 모두에게 인기가 좋다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "經過深灰科學博物館監修的桌巾。散發學院氣氛的花紋從小孩子到大人都愛不釋手。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe créée au Musée des Sciences d’Argenta. Son motif rappelant des schémas scientifiques la rend populaire auprès de tous, de 7 à 77 ans.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das Marmoria City-Wissenschaftsmuseum war bei der Gestaltung dieses Tischtuchs federführend. Es findet mit seiner kultivierten Farbgebung Anklang bei Jung und Alt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diseñado bajo la supervisión del Museo de la Ciencia de Ciudad Plateada. Los colores y motivos académicos de este mantel agradan tanto a niños como adultos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia creata con la supervisione del Museo della Scienza di Plumbeopoli. Il design dall’aria accademica riscuote grande successo tra grandi e piccini.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A tablecloth designed by the Pewter Museum of Science. The academic air of the pattern is a big hit with kids and adults alike.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ニビ科学博物館　監修の　テーブルクロス。アカデミックな　雰囲気の色柄は子供にも　大人にも　大人気。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由深灰科学博物馆监制的桌巾。充满学术氛围的配色与图案小孩大人都喜欢。",
